{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"saf77e33181c7d515","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-70744c3466ec978422a7","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"saf77e33181c7d515","text":"우아… 고마워, 징! 오래 걸렸지만, 드디어 여기에 사람이 오긴 했네, 징","speaker":"사제 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"사제 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8894748653287362355"],"speakerHashCandidates":["68400337027224642"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-d4139e9df8644ca8ee74","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"saf77e33181c7d515","text":"한때 이곳은 성지였어. 티탄은 이곳에서 신탁을 내렸고, 연맹은 여기서 중요한 일들을 상의했지","speaker":"사제 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"사제 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17713275109600327824"],"speakerHashCandidates":["68400337027224642"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-a2be716fbc89c87129b2","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"saf77e33181c7d515","text":"하지만 안타깝게도 성지는 파괴되었고, 지금 하늘에 남은 건 적막뿐이야. 더 이상 신들의 소리는 들리지 않게 되었어, 징……","speaker":"사제 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"사제 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16212477817377851941"],"speakerHashCandidates":["68400337027224642"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-59466236dd3d980b01b7","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"saf77e33181c7d515","text":"아얏, 아파!","speaker":"사제 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"사제 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11659121118245511995"],"speakerHashCandidates":["68400337027224642"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-946ae78d7c249c183219","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"saf77e33181c7d515","text":"젠장, 나 왜 또 묻혀있는 거지? 어서 날 구해줘, 징!","speaker":"사제 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"사제 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3835390641367613963"],"speakerHashCandidates":["68400337027224642"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"s